eBid Hub — Unified Business Rules & Process Workflows

eBid Hub

*Unified Business Rules **&** Process Workflows*

Super Admin: Piyush Singhal

Contact: psinghalnoida@gmail.com

Status: Fully reconciled — supersedes all prior governance drafts and the separately-issued Consolidated Specification.

*This document is the single, absolute source of truth for eBid Hub's business rules (BR) and process workflows (PR). Every rule reflects a decision explicitly discussed and finalized with the Super Admin (BR-01). No item in this document is left ambiguous; where a decision is intentionally deferred, it is called out explicitly under Open Items.*

